      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that the current CL is not correct.\nThe comments in the CL since then have touched on a few possible approaches to solving the observed problem -- the current HAL interface/implementation cost more than we want on certain low-powered devices.\n\nAt this point, I think the discussion should continue in a buganizer bug/feature request rather than as comments in this CL. If you want to continue, please file such a bug.",
